# PR Creator Skill Development

When working on the pull-requests plugin, the skill definitions are the source of truth —
do not duplicate their workflows here.

- **PR creation skill**: [`plugins/pull-requests/skills/pr-creator/SKILL.md`](mdc:plugins/pull-requests/skills/pr-creator/SKILL.md)
  (template discovery, commit/diff analysis, gap detection, `gh pr create --body-file`, never `--fill`)
- **Conflict resolution skill**: [`plugins/pull-requests/skills/pr-conflict-resolver/SKILL.md`](mdc:plugins/pull-requests/skills/pr-conflict-resolver/SKILL.md)
- **Commands**: [`plugins/pull-requests/commands/`](mdc:plugins/pull-requests/commands/) — thin wrappers (`/pr`, `/pr-update`, `/pr-comment-review`, `/merge-conflicts`) that invoke the skills

When changing PR behavior, edit the skill; commands should only carry usage, arguments,
and the delegation note.
